tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-398-a-function-with-an-at-parameter-has-no-value.hero:55:9: error[mutable_parameter_as_value]: `bump` changes its argument `n` through `@`, and a function value cannot: no function type carries an `@` (§ 9), so `bump` is only called by name, its `n` marked `@` at the call
